# UNDERDELVE: cave dwellers. Glow-worms live in a few rooms; press UP beside
# one and it says its one cryptic line (a hint about the altar, the still
# pools, the dead man's door, the mirrored carving or the fake walls).
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 1 2 10 130
cheat clear_enemies
wait 5
expect hint == 0
hold RIGHT 30
press UP
wait 5
expect hint == 1
wait 400
expect hint == 0
